# Boards this example is built and gated for, one per line. The M.2 Key E socket
# (IW416: Bluetooth HCI on LPUART2) is on the MIMXRT1170-EVKB and on Nosh, not on
# the 1060 boards. The nosh half boots the EVKB machine through gate-lib's nosh
# arm and plays into Nosh's SGTL5000 (AVRCP volume lands on the DAC digital
# volume: Nosh has LINE OUT only). The gate builds its own image per board
# through gate_cmake_board_args. Load-sensitive class on both boards (CLAUDE.md
# 2026-09-18 note): a red half under a busy host is re-run idle before it counts.
rt1176
nosh
